### GET ALL SCREENS
GET http://localhost:4000/screens


### GET  SCREEN BY ID

GET http://localhost:4000/screens/1


### CREATE SCREEN
POST http://localhost:4000/screens/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "theatre_id": 1,
    "name": "Screen 1"
}

### UPDATE SCREEN
PUT http://localhost:4000/screens/update/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "theatre_id": 1,
    "name": "Screen 1 Updated"
}

### DELETE SCREEN
DELETE http://localhost:4000/screens/delete/1


### GET SEATS FOR SCREEN
GET http://localhost:4000/screens/2/seats

### CREATE SEAT
POST http://localhost:4000/screens/2/seats/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "row_label": "A",
    "seat_number": 2,
    "tier": "regular"
}


### UPDATE SEAT
PUT http://localhost:4000/seats/update/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "row_label": "A",
    "seat_number": 1,
    "tier": "premium"
}

### DELETE SEAT
DELETE http://localhost:4000/seats/delete/1






